@continuumreed Thank you! You seem pretty familiar with hair so I'll try not to go on too much.

Basically, I pulled some surfaces from the scalp, split into sections and shaped into curls. Used geometry nodes to distribute curves on these surfaces, adjusting density and aligning tilt to surface normals etc. Curves then create hair cards also using geometry nodes so I can set the width, UV position etc.

Was a bit of a challenge, but I think it worked well.

